silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_05_probe_ungated_render_decomposition_step_5__step_yrendereddiagram_from_ungated_!=_yrendereddiagram_from_validated a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The profile of a rendered diagram should match the profile of the admitted claim. If the render bypasses the gate, the profiles differ: the reader traversing the Yoneda profile of the ungated figure finds the measurement leg missing; the profile of the admitted figure includes the measurement leg (MeasurementEvent2024 -> Mittens via measures)." .
